@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### 회원가입
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123!",
  "nickname": "koji"
}

### 회원가입 2 (친구 추가용)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "password123!",
  "nickname": "koji2"
}

### 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123!"
}

#### 로그아웃
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### 로그인 친구 추가용
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test3@example.com",
  "password": "password123!"
}